ess a custom `getsizeof` is passed.\n\n## Phase 1: Design & Contracts\n\nSee generated artifacts below.\n\n### Complexity Tracking\n\nNo complexity violations detected. Single class, minimal scope.\nPLAN_EOF", "exit_code": 0, "stderr": "", "stdout": ""}